<title>USA: Comair Nov load factor falls to 52.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Comair Nov load factor falls to 52.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p>			    1996	     1995	     % Change</p>
<p> ASMs (000)	     230,326	  191,846		20.1%</p>
<p> RPMs (000)	     121,835	  108,121		12.7%</p>
<p> LOAD FACTOR		52.9%	    56.4%		-6.1%</p>
<p> PASSENGERS	     365,713	  349,472		 4.6%</p>
<p>					    FISCAL YTD</p>
<p>				1997	    1996	    % Change</p>
<p> ASMs (000)	     1,830,314	1,553,147	     17.8%</p>
