<p> LOAD FACTOR		  57.2%	    54.0%		5.8%</p>
<p> PASSENGERS	     3,179,523	2,682,079	     18.5%</p>
<p>Full company name is Comair Holdings Inc</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
